This repository contains no model weights and no third-party binaries. The scripts download them, check
their published SHA-256, and build them into local images. Their own licences apply:

- Qwen3-4B-Instruct-2507 (the default) and Qwen3-1.7B (used in the experiments), quantised to GGUF and
  published on Docker Hub as ai/qwen3: Apache License 2.0. The 4B file's own metadata states
  general.license = apache-2.0; for both, Qwen's README says "All our open-weight models are licensed under
  Apache 2.0." https://github.com/QwenLM/Qwen3
- Ollama (the model runtime): MIT License. https://github.com/ollama/ollama
- Spring Boot, ArchUnit, Maven: Apache License 2.0.
